	                  Window:Tag({ Title = "v1.0" }) pills sit right after the hub name (WindUI style) on the same row and can be long (they only scroll when the window is too narrow). Template divider lines are hidden (ShowDividers = true keeps them).
	                  CreateWindow({ CloseDialog = false }) = the close button destroys the window without asking

	Custom themes (like WindUI):
	  Library:AddTheme({ Name = "Ocean", Accent = "#..", Dialog = "#..", Text = "#..", Background = "#..", Button = "#..", Icon = "#..", Placeholder = "#..", Toggle = "#..", Slider = "#..", Checkbox = "#..", Primary = "#.." })
